('nsmq_phys_sr_075', 'topic_modern_physics', 'subj_wassce_physics', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'What is nuclear fission?', 'direct_answer', 'speed_race', NULL, 'Splitting of heavy nucleus', 'Fission splits heavy nuclei into lighter ones', 'medium', 2, 1, 15, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_001', 'topic_acc_intro', 'subj_wassce_accounting', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Which of the following is NOT a user of accounting information?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Shareholders","Government","Competitors for personal gain","Creditors"]', 'Competitors for personal gain', 'While competitors may analyze public financial information, using it solely for personal gain is not a legitimate use. Shareholders, government, and creditors are all recognized users of accounting information.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_002', 'topic_acc_books', 'subj_wassce_accounting', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Sales Day Book is used to record:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Cash sales only","Credit sales only","Both cash and credit sales","Returns from customers"]', 'B', 'The Sales Day Book (or Sales Journal) records only credit sales. Cash sales are recorded in the Cash Book.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_003', 'topic_acc_ledger', 'subj_wassce_accounting', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'In double-entry bookkeeping, when goods are sold on credit, the entries are:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Debit Sales, Credit Debtor","Debit Debtor, Credit Sales","Debit Cash, Credit Sales","Debit Sales, Credit Cash"]', 'B', 'When goods are sold on credit, the debtor (customer) account is debited (asset increases) and Sales account is credited (income increases).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_004', 'topic_acc_trial', 'subj_wassce_accounting', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A trial balance proves that:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["All transactions are correctly recorded","The books are arithmetically accurate","No errors exist in the books","The business is profitable"]', 'The books are arithmetically accurate', 'A trial balance only proves arithmetic accuracy - that debits equal credits. It does not detect errors of principle, commission, or compensating errors.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_005', 'topic_acc_depreciation', 'subj_wassce_accounting', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Using the straight-line method, an asset costing GHS 50,000 with a residual value of GHS 5,000 and useful life of 9 years has annual depreciation of:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["GHS 5,000","GHS 5,556","GHS 4,500","GHS 6,000"]', 'GHS 5,000', 'Straight-line depreciation = (Cost - Residual Value) / Useful Life = (50,000 - 5,000) / 9 = 45,000 / 9 = GHS 5,000 per year.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_001', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Assets are resources:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Owed by the business", "B. Owned by the business", "C. Only in cash form", "D. Belonging to creditors"]', 'B', 'Assets are resources owned by the business that have future economic benefits.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_002', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Liabilities represent:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. What the business owns", "B. What the business owes", "C. Business profits", "D. Owner''s investment"]', 'B', 'Liabilities are obligations or amounts owed by the business to others.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 2, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_003', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Capital represents:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Business debts", "B. Owner''s claim on business assets", "C. Money in the bank", "D. Profit only"]', 'B', 'Capital (owner''s equity) represents the owner''s claim on the net assets of the business.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 3, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_004', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'The business entity concept states that:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Business and owner are the same", "B. Business is separate from its owner", "C. Only limited companies are separate", "D. Personal expenses are business expenses"]', 'B', 'The entity concept treats the business as separate from its owner(s).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 4, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_005', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Drawings represent:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Business expenses", "B. Owner''s withdrawals from business", "C. Money received", "D. Additional investment"]', 'B', 'Drawings are assets (usually cash or goods) withdrawn by the owner for personal use.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 5, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_006', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Which of these is a fixed asset?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Cash", "B. Debtors", "C. Machinery", "D. Stock"]', 'C', 'Machinery is a fixed asset held for long-term use in the business.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 6, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_007', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Revenue expenditure is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Expenditure on fixed assets", "B. Day-to-day running expenses", "C. Capital investment", "D. Long-term investment"]', 'B', 'Revenue expenditure covers day-to-day expenses that benefit the current period only.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 7, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_008', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Capital expenditure includes:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Wages", "B. Purchase of fixed assets", "C. Rent", "D. Electricity"]', 'B', 'Capital expenditure is spending on acquiring or improving fixed assets.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 8, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_009', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'The prudence concept requires:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Anticipating profits", "B. Not anticipating profits, providing for losses", "C. Ignoring losses", "D. Recording only cash transactions"]', 'B', 'Prudence requires not recognizing profits until realized but providing for anticipated losses.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 9, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_010', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'The consistency concept requires:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Changing methods yearly", "B. Using same methods from period to period", "C. Different methods for different assets", "D. No depreciation"]', 'B', 'Consistency requires using the same accounting methods from one period to another.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 10, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_011', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'A credit entry records:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Increase in assets", "B. Decrease in liabilities", "C. Increase in liabilities or income", "D. Decrease in income"]', 'C', 'Credits record increases in liabilities, income, and capital, and decreases in assets and expenses.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 11, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_012', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'A debit entry records:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Increase in liabilities", "B. Decrease in assets", "C. Increase in assets or expenses", "D. Increase in capital"]', 'C', 'Debits record increases in assets and expenses, and decreases in liabilities, income, and capital.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 12, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_013', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Purchase of goods on credit is recorded as:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Debit Purchases, Credit Cash", "B. Debit Purchases, Credit Supplier", "C. Debit Supplier, Credit Purchases", "D. Debit Cash, Credit Supplier"]', 'B', 'Credit purchase: Debit Purchases (expense increases), Credit Supplier/Creditor (liability increases).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 13, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_014', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Cash received from a debtor is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Debit Debtor, Credit Cash", "B. Debit Cash, Credit Debtor", "C. Debit Cash, Credit Sales", "D. Debit Sales, Credit Cash"]', 'B', 'Cash received from debtor: Debit Cash (asset increases), Credit Debtor (asset decreases).', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 14, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_015', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Payment of rent is recorded as:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Debit Cash, Credit Rent", "B. Debit Rent, Credit Cash", "C. Debit Landlord, Credit Cash", "D. Debit Cash, Credit Landlord"]', 'B', 'Payment of rent: Debit Rent expense, Credit Cash/Bank.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 15, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_016', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'The purchases day book records:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Cash purchases", "B. Credit purchases of goods", "C. All purchases", "D. Fixed asset purchases"]', 'B', 'The purchases day book (purchases journal) records credit purchases of goods only.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 16, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_017', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Returns inwards journal records:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Goods returned by the business", "B. Goods returned by customers", "C. Damaged goods", "D. Stock losses"]', 'B', 'Returns inwards (sales returns) journal records goods returned by customers.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 17, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_018', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'The balance on a debtor''s account shows:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Amount we owe them", "B. Amount they owe us", "C. Total sales", "D. Total receipts"]', 'B', 'A debtor''s balance represents the amount the customer owes the business.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 18, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_019', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Discounts allowed are given to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Suppliers", "B. Customers", "C. Employees", "D. Banks"]', 'B', 'Discounts allowed are given to customers for early payment.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 19, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_020', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Cash discount differs from trade discount because it is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Larger", "B. Recorded in the books", "C. Given on purchases only", "D. Fixed by law"]', 'B', 'Cash discount is recorded in the books; trade discount is deducted before recording.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 20, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_021', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'A trial balance that balances proves:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. All entries are correct", "B. Equal debits and credits were recorded", "C. No errors exist", "D. Profit was made"]', 'B', 'A balanced trial balance only proves that total debits equal total credits, not that all entries are correct.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 21, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_022', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Which error will NOT affect trial balance agreement?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Addition error", "B. Error of commission", "C. Posting to wrong side", "D. Omitting one entry"]', 'B', 'Error of commission (wrong account of same class) doesn''t affect trial balance totals.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 22, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_023', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Error of omission occurs when:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Wrong amount recorded", "B. Transaction completely left out", "C. Entry on wrong side", "D. Wrong account used"]', 'B', 'Error of omission is when a transaction is completely not recorded.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 23, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_024', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Error of principle occurs when:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Wrong amount recorded", "B. Item recorded in wrong class of account", "C. Entry omitted", "D. Figures transposed"]', 'B', 'Error of principle is posting to wrong type of account (e.g., expense to asset).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 24, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_025', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Compensating errors:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Can never occur", "B. Cancel each other out", "C. Always affect trial balance", "D. Only occur in journals"]', 'B', 'Compensating errors are two or more errors that cancel each other out.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 25, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_026', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'A suspense account is used to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Calculate profit", "B. Temporarily balance the trial balance", "C. Record capital", "D. Store assets"]', 'B', 'A suspense account temporarily holds the difference while errors are investigated.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 26, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_027', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Error of original entry means:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Entry omitted", "B. Correct accounts but wrong amount in both", "C. Wrong account used", "D. Entry duplicated"]', 'B', 'Error of original entry is when the wrong amount is recorded in both accounts.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 27, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_028', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'A transposition error involves:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Omitting digits", "B. Reversing order of digits", "C. Adding extra digits", "D. Using wrong account"]', 'B', 'A transposition error reverses the order of digits (e.g., 53 instead of 35).', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 28, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_029', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Which appears in the trial balance?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Gross profit", "B. Net profit", "C. Purchases", "D. Cost of goods sold"]', 'C', 'Purchases appears in the trial balance; gross profit, net profit, and COGS are calculated later.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 29, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_030', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'A debit balance on the capital account indicates:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Profit", "B. Net assets exceed liabilities", "C. Drawings exceed capital + profit", "D. Business is successful"]', 'C', 'A debit capital balance means drawings exceed capital invested plus accumulated profits.', 'hard', 3, 1, 30, 30, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_031', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Returns outwards is deducted from:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Sales", "B. Purchases", "C. Gross profit", "D. Net profit"]', 'B', 'Returns outwards (purchase returns) is deducted from purchases.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 31, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_032', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Income received in advance is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. A current asset", "B. A current liability", "C. An expense", "D. Capital"]', 'B', 'Income received in advance is a liability (obligation to provide service).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 32, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_033', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Accrued income is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Income received but not earned", "B. Income earned but not yet received", "C. An expense", "D. A liability"]', 'B', 'Accrued income is revenue earned but not yet received at the end of the period.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 33, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_034', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Goods taken by owner for personal use are:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Credited to purchases", "B. Debited to drawings", "C. Credited to sales", "D. Both B and C"]', 'D', 'Goods taken by owner: Debit Drawings, Credit Purchases (at cost) or Credit Sales (at selling price for some methods).', 'hard', 3, 1, 30, 34, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_035', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'The balance sheet shows:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Profit for the year", "B. Assets, liabilities and capital at a point in time", "C. Cash flow", "D. Sales and purchases"]', 'B', 'The balance sheet shows the financial position at a specific point in time.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 35, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_036', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Goodwill is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. A tangible asset", "B. An intangible asset", "C. A liability", "D. An expense"]', 'B', 'Goodwill is an intangible asset representing the value of reputation and customer relationships.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 36, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_037', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Stock is valued at:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Cost only", "B. Market value only", "C. Lower of cost or net realizable value", "D. Higher of cost or market value"]', 'C', 'Stock is valued at the lower of cost or net realizable value (prudence).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 37, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_038', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'A sole trader''s capital account balance represents:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Profit only", "B. Cash in bank", "C. Owner''s equity in the business", "D. Total assets"]', 'C', 'Capital represents the owner''s claim on the net assets of the business.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 38, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_039', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Interest on capital is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. An expense in P&L", "B. Added to capital", "C. A liability", "D. An asset"]', 'A', 'Interest on capital is an expense in the profit and loss account and added to capital.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 39, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_040', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Goods destroyed by fire with no insurance is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. A normal expense", "B. An abnormal loss debited to P&L", "C. Not recorded", "D. Added to purchases"]', 'B', 'Uninsured loss from fire is an abnormal loss charged to the profit and loss account.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 40, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_041', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'A manufacturing account calculates:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Gross profit", "B. Cost of production", "C. Net profit", "D. Sales revenue"]', 'B', 'The manufacturing account calculates the cost of goods manufactured.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 41, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_042', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Prime cost consists of:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Direct materials + Direct labor", "B. All factory costs", "C. Administrative costs", "D. Selling costs"]', 'A', 'Prime cost = Direct Materials + Direct Labor + Direct Expenses.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 42, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_043', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Factory overheads include:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Direct wages", "B. Raw materials", "C. Factory rent and power", "D. Sales commission"]', 'C', 'Factory overheads are indirect manufacturing costs like factory rent, power, and supervision.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 43, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_044', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Work-in-progress represents:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Finished goods", "B. Partially completed goods", "C. Raw materials", "D. Goods in transit"]', 'B', 'Work-in-progress consists of partially completed goods at the end of a period.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 44, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_045', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'In a partnership, profit is distributed according to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Capital ratios only", "B. Partnership agreement", "C. Equally always", "D. Number of partners"]', 'B', 'Profits are distributed according to the partnership agreement (or equally if no agreement).', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 45, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_046', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Appropriation account shows:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. How profit is calculated", "B. How profit is distributed", "C. All expenses", "D. All income"]', 'B', 'The appropriation account shows how profit is distributed among partners.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 46, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_047', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'A partner''s current account shows:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Fixed capital", "B. Share of profits, drawings, and salaries", "C. Total investment", "D. Loan to partnership"]', 'B', 'The current account records profit shares, drawings, salaries, and interest.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 47, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_048', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'In a not-for-profit organization, the equivalent of profit is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Revenue", "B. Surplus", "C. Income", "D. Dividend"]', 'B', 'Non-profit organizations refer to excess of income over expenditure as surplus (not profit).', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 48, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_049', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'Subscriptions received in advance are:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Income", "B. A liability", "C. An asset", "D. Capital"]', 'B', 'Subscriptions received in advance are a liability (obligation to provide service).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 49, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2023_050', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2023_1', 'The receipts and payments account is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. An income statement", "B. A cash summary", "C. A balance sheet", "D. A bank reconciliation"]', 'B', 'The receipts and payments account is a summary of cash and bank transactions.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 50, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_001', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The accounting equation is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Assets = Liabilities - Capital", "B. Assets = Liabilities + Capital", "C. Assets + Liabilities = Capital", "D. Capital = Assets + Liabilities"]', 'B', 'The accounting equation is Assets = Liabilities + Capital (Owner''s Equity).', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_002', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Which of the following is a source document?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Trial balance", "B. Invoice", "C. Journal", "D. Ledger"]', 'B', 'An invoice is a source document that provides evidence of a transaction.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 2, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_003', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The principle that requires expenses to be recorded in the same period as related revenues is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Going concern", "B. Matching principle", "C. Prudence", "D. Consistency"]', 'B', 'The matching principle requires expenses to be matched with the revenues they help generate.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 3, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_004', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The double entry principle requires that:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Every transaction has only one entry", "B. Every debit has a corresponding credit", "C. All entries are made in the cash book", "D. Only credit transactions are recorded"]', 'B', 'Double entry requires every debit to have an equal and corresponding credit entry.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 4, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_005', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Which of these is a current asset?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Land", "B. Motor vehicle", "C. Inventory", "D. Machinery"]', 'C', 'Inventory (stock) is a current asset expected to be converted to cash within one year.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 5, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z')
INSERT INTO "questions" (id, topic_id, subject_id, exam_type_id, paper_type_id, past_paper_id, question_text, question_type, round_type, options, correct_answer, explanation, difficulty, points, marks, time_limit, question_number, section, is_compulsory, image_url, syllabus_topic_id, command_word, assessment_objective, source_paper_code, source_question_number, exam_board_id, created_at, updated_at) VALUES
('q_acc_2024_006', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The book of original entry for credit sales is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Cash book", "B. Sales journal", "C. Purchases journal", "D. General journal"]', 'B', 'The sales journal (sales day book) records all credit sales.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 6, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_007', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Carriage inwards is added to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Sales", "B. Purchases", "C. Closing stock", "D. Gross profit"]', 'B', 'Carriage inwards (freight in) is added to the cost of purchases.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 7, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_008', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The concept that assumes a business will continue indefinitely is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Accrual concept", "B. Going concern", "C. Prudence", "D. Consistency"]', 'B', 'The going concern concept assumes the business will continue operating for the foreseeable future.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 8, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_009', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Trade discount is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Recorded in the books", "B. Deducted from invoice before recording", "C. Added to the selling price", "D. Only given for cash sales"]', 'B', 'Trade discount is deducted before recording; only the net amount is recorded.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 9, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_010', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The purpose of a trial balance is to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Calculate profit", "B. Check arithmetical accuracy", "C. Prepare financial statements", "D. Record transactions"]', 'B', 'A trial balance verifies that debits equal credits (arithmetical accuracy).', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 10, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_011', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The three-column cash book records:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Cash only", "B. Bank only", "C. Cash, bank and discount", "D. Cash and petty cash"]', 'C', 'A three-column cash book has columns for cash, bank, and discount.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 11, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_012', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The petty cash book is maintained using:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Single entry system", "B. Imprest system", "C. Double entry system", "D. Receipt system"]', 'B', 'The imprest system maintains a fixed petty cash float that is reimbursed periodically.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 12, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_013', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'A credit balance on a debtor''s account indicates:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Amount owed by debtor", "B. Amount owed to debtor (overpayment)", "C. Discount allowed", "D. Bad debt"]', 'B', 'A credit balance in a debtor''s account means the customer has overpaid.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 13, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_014', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Contra entry involves:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Two separate books", "B. Cash and bank columns of the same cash book", "C. Sales and purchases journals", "D. Journal and ledger"]', 'B', 'A contra entry is a transfer between cash and bank columns in the cash book.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 14, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_015', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The sales ledger contains accounts of:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Creditors", "B. Debtors", "C. Assets", "D. Expenses"]', 'B', 'The sales ledger (debtors ledger) contains individual customer accounts.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 15, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_016', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'When goods are returned by a customer, the entry is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Debit Sales, Credit Customer", "B. Debit Sales Returns, Credit Customer", "C. Debit Customer, Credit Sales Returns", "D. Debit Cash, Credit Sales"]', 'B', 'Sales returns is debited and the customer''s account is credited.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 16, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_017', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The general journal is used for:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Cash transactions", "B. Credit sales", "C. Opening entries and corrections", "D. Bank transactions"]', 'C', 'The general journal records opening entries, adjustments, and corrections not in other journals.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 17, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_018', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'A folio reference helps to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Calculate totals", "B. Cross-reference between books", "C. Find errors", "D. Balance accounts"]', 'B', 'Folio references provide cross-references between journals and ledgers for easy tracing.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 18, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_019', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Discount received is recorded in the:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Debit side of cash book", "B. Credit side of cash book", "C. Credit side of purchases account", "D. Debit side of sales account"]', 'B', 'Discount received is recorded on the credit side of the cash book (discount column).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 19, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_020', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The purchases ledger control account has a:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Debit balance", "B. Credit balance", "C. Zero balance", "D. Either debit or credit"]', 'B', 'The purchases ledger control account normally has a credit balance (amounts owed to creditors).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 20, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_021', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Gross profit is calculated as:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Sales - Expenses", "B. Sales - Cost of Goods Sold", "C. Net profit + Expenses", "D. Cost of Sales + Expenses"]', 'B', 'Gross Profit = Sales - Cost of Goods Sold.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 21, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_022', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Cost of goods sold equals:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Opening stock + Purchases - Closing stock", "B. Purchases only", "C. Opening stock + Closing stock", "D. Purchases - Returns"]', 'A', 'COGS = Opening Stock + Purchases - Closing Stock (adjusted for carriage inwards and returns).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 22, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_023', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Closing stock appears in:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Trial balance only", "B. Trading account only", "C. Trading account and balance sheet", "D. Balance sheet only"]', 'C', 'Closing stock appears in the trading account and as a current asset in the balance sheet.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 23, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_024', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Carriage outwards is treated as:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Cost of goods sold", "B. A selling expense", "C. Purchase cost", "D. An asset"]', 'B', 'Carriage outwards (delivery expense) is a selling and distribution expense.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 24, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_025', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Net profit is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Gross profit - Expenses + Incomes", "B. Sales - All costs", "C. Gross profit + Expenses", "D. Total revenue only"]', 'A', 'Net Profit = Gross Profit - Operating Expenses + Other Incomes.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 25, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_026', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Which of these is a current liability?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Bank loan (5 years)", "B. Trade payables", "C. Capital", "D. Premises"]', 'B', 'Trade payables (creditors) are current liabilities due within one year.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 26, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_027', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Prepaid expenses are shown as:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Current liabilities", "B. Current assets", "C. Expenses in P&L", "D. Non-current assets"]', 'B', 'Prepaid expenses are current assets (amounts paid in advance for future benefits).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 27, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_028', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Accrued expenses are:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Paid in advance", "B. Expenses owing but not yet paid", "C. Non-business expenses", "D. Written off expenses"]', 'B', 'Accrued expenses are incurred but not yet paid at the end of the accounting period.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 28, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_029', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Working capital is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Total assets", "B. Current assets - Current liabilities", "C. Fixed assets only", "D. Cash only"]', 'B', 'Working Capital = Current Assets - Current Liabilities.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 29, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_030', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Capital at the end of the year equals:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Opening capital + Profit - Drawings", "B. Opening capital only", "C. Assets - Expenses", "D. Profit - Loss"]', 'A', 'Closing Capital = Opening Capital + Net Profit - Drawings (+ additional capital).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 30, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_031', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Depreciation represents:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Market value decline", "B. Allocation of asset cost over useful life", "C. Repair costs", "D. Insurance of assets"]', 'B', 'Depreciation allocates the cost of a fixed asset over its estimated useful life.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 31, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_032', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Under straight-line method, annual depreciation equals:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. (Cost - Residual value) × Rate", "B. (Cost - Residual value) ÷ Useful life", "C. Cost × Rate", "D. Book value × Rate"]', 'B', 'Straight-line depreciation = (Cost - Residual Value) ÷ Useful Life.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 32, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_033', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'The reducing balance method calculates depreciation on:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Original cost", "B. Net book value", "C. Residual value", "D. Replacement cost"]', 'B', 'Reducing balance applies the rate to the net book value (carrying amount) each year.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 33, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_acc_2024_034', NULL, 'subj_wassce_accounting', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_acc_2024_1', 'Provision for bad debts is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. A liability", "B. An expense", "C. A contra asset", "D. Revenue"]', 'C', 'Provision for bad debts is a contra asset that reduces trade receivables.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 34, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
