('q_bece_bdt_2023_040', NULL, 'subj_bece_bdt', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_bdt_2023_1', 'Appliqué is a technique of:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Painting", "B. Attaching fabric pieces onto a background", "C. Sculpting", "D. Drawing"]', 'B', 'Appliqué is a textile technique where pieces of fabric are sewn onto a larger background to create designs.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 40, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
