('q_bece_ict_2024_017', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'A set of instructions that tells the computer what to do is called:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Hardware", "B. Software", "C. Monitor", "D. Keyboard"]', 'B', 'Software is a set of instructions (programs) that tell the computer hardware what to do and how to do it.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 17, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_018', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Which of the following is presentation software?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Notepad", "B. Calculator", "C. PowerPoint", "D. Paint"]', 'C', 'PowerPoint is presentation software used to create slideshows and visual presentations.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 18, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_019', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'The desktop icons represent:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Files and programs", "B. Computer hardware", "C. Internet websites", "D. Paper documents"]', 'A', 'Desktop icons are graphical representations of files, folders, and programs that can be opened by clicking on them.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 19, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_020', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'To save a document using the keyboard, you press:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Ctrl + P", "B. Ctrl + S", "C. Ctrl + C", "D. Ctrl + V"]', 'B', 'Ctrl + S is the keyboard shortcut for saving a document. Ctrl + P prints, Ctrl + C copies, and Ctrl + V pastes.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 20, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_021', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'WWW stands for:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. World Wide Web", "B. World Web Wide", "C. Wide World Web", "D. Web Wide World"]', 'A', 'WWW stands for World Wide Web, which is a system of interlinked hypertext documents accessed via the internet.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 21, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_022', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Which of the following is a web browser?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Windows", "B. Google Chrome", "C. Microsoft Word", "D. Photoshop"]', 'B', 'Google Chrome is a web browser used to access and navigate the internet. Windows is an OS, Word and Photoshop are applications.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 22, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z')
