('q_bece_ict_2024_023', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'An email address must contain the symbol:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. #", "B. @", "C. &", "D. $"]', 'B', 'All email addresses must contain the @ symbol, which separates the username from the domain name (e.g., user@domain.com).', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 23, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_024', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'A group of computers connected together to share resources is called:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Internet", "B. Network", "C. Server", "D. Database"]', 'B', 'A network is a group of computers and devices connected together to share resources, data, and communicate with each other.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 24, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_025', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'What does URL stand for?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Uniform Resource Locator", "B. Universal Resource Locator", "C. Uniform Resource Link", "D. Universal Resource Link"]', 'A', 'URL stands for Uniform Resource Locator. It is the address of a webpage or resource on the internet.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 25, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_026', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'A search engine is used to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Send emails", "B. Create documents", "C. Find information on the internet", "D. Play videos"]', 'C', 'A search engine like Google or Bing is used to find information, websites, images, and other content on the internet.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 26, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_027', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Which of the following is NOT a search engine?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Google", "B. Yahoo", "C. Facebook", "D. Bing"]', 'C', 'Facebook is a social networking site, not a search engine. Google, Yahoo, and Bing are all search engines.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 27, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_028', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'The abbreviation "http" stands for:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Hyper Text Transfer Protocol", "B. High Text Transfer Protocol", "C. Hyper Text Transport Protocol", "D. High Text Transport Protocol"]', 'A', 'HTTP stands for Hyper Text Transfer Protocol, which is the foundation of data communication on the World Wide Web.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 28, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_029', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'An ISP provides:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Computer repairs", "B. Internet access", "C. Software development", "D. Hardware manufacturing"]', 'B', 'ISP stands for Internet Service Provider. It is a company that provides customers with internet access and related services.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 29, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_030', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Wi-Fi is a technology used for:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Printing documents", "B. Wireless internet connection", "C. Scanning images", "D. Recording audio"]', 'B', 'Wi-Fi is a wireless technology that allows devices to connect to the internet without physical cables.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 30, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_031', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'A computer virus is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. A hardware problem", "B. A beneficial program", "C. A harmful program", "D. A type of browser"]', 'C', 'A computer virus is a harmful program designed to damage, disrupt, or gain unauthorized access to computer systems.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 31, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_032', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Software used to protect computers from viruses is called:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Malware", "B. Antivirus", "C. Shareware", "D. Freeware"]', 'B', 'Antivirus software is designed to detect, prevent, and remove malicious software including viruses, worms, and trojans.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 32, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_033', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'A password should be:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Easy to guess", "B. Your name or birthday", "C. Strong and unique", "D. Shared with friends"]', 'C', 'A password should be strong and unique, combining letters, numbers, and symbols to protect your accounts from unauthorized access.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 33, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_034', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Cyberbullying refers to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Playing online games", "B. Harassment using electronic means", "C. Sending emails", "D. Creating websites"]', 'B', 'Cyberbullying is the use of electronic communication to bully, harass, or intimidate someone, often repeatedly.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 34, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_035', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Which of the following is an example of cybercrime?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Watching movies online", "B. Hacking into accounts", "C. Using social media", "D. Sending emails"]', 'B', 'Hacking into someone''s accounts without permission is a cybercrime. It involves unauthorized access to computer systems.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 35, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_036', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Copyright protects:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Computer hardware", "B. Original creative works", "C. Computer viruses", "D. Network cables"]', 'B', 'Copyright is a legal right that protects original creative works like books, music, software, and art from unauthorized use.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 36, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_037', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Downloading and using software without paying for it is called:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Software development", "B. Software piracy", "C. Software testing", "D. Software installation"]', 'B', 'Software piracy is the illegal copying, distribution, or use of copyrighted software without proper authorization or payment.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 37, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_038', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'To avoid eye strain when using a computer, you should:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Sit very close to the screen", "B. Take regular breaks", "C. Keep room lights off", "D. Stare at the screen continuously"]', 'B', 'Taking regular breaks (20-20-20 rule) helps prevent eye strain. Looking away from the screen every 20 minutes reduces stress on your eyes.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 38, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_039', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Phishing is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. A type of online game", "B. A method of catching fish", "C. A cyber attack to steal personal information", "D. A type of computer software"]', 'C', 'Phishing is a cyber attack where criminals pose as legitimate organizations to trick people into revealing personal information like passwords or credit card numbers.', 'hard', 3, 1, 30, 39, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_ict_2024_040', NULL, 'subj_bece_ict', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_ict_2024_1', 'Which of the following is good practice when using social media?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Sharing your password with friends", "B. Posting your home address", "C. Keeping personal information private", "D. Accepting all friend requests"]', 'C', 'Keeping personal information private on social media protects you from identity theft, cyberstalking, and other online threats.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 40, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_liv_001', NULL, 'subj_bece_science', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The basic unit of life is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Tissue","Organ","Cell","System"]', 'Cell', 'The cell is the basic structural and functional unit of all living things.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_liv_002', NULL, 'subj_bece_science', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Plants make their own food through:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Respiration","Photosynthesis","Digestion","Excretion"]', 'Photosynthesis', 'Photosynthesis is the process by which plants make food using sunlight.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_liv_003', NULL, 'subj_bece_science', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The organ that pumps blood in humans is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Lungs","Liver","Heart","Kidney"]', 'Heart', 'The heart pumps blood throughout the body.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_liv_004', NULL, 'subj_bece_science', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Animals that eat only plants are called:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Carnivores","Herbivores","Omnivores","Decomposers"]', 'Herbivores', 'Herbivores eat only plants. Carnivores eat meat, omnivores eat both.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_liv_005', NULL, 'subj_bece_science', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The process by which organisms produce offspring is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Respiration","Excretion","Reproduction","Nutrition"]', 'Reproduction', 'Reproduction is the biological process of producing new individuals.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_mat_001', NULL, 'subj_bece_science', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The three states of matter are:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Hot, cold, warm","Solid, liquid, gas","Small, medium, large","Light, heavy, medium"]', 'Solid, liquid, gas', 'Matter exists in three main states: solid, liquid, and gas.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_mat_002', NULL, 'subj_bece_science', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'When water freezes, it becomes:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Steam","Ice","Vapor","Liquid"]', 'Ice', 'Freezing changes water from liquid to solid (ice).', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_mat_003', NULL, 'subj_bece_science', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Energy from the sun is called:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Electrical energy","Solar energy","Chemical energy","Sound energy"]', 'Solar energy', 'Solar energy is energy from the sun.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_mat_004', NULL, 'subj_bece_science', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A simple machine that is a rigid bar that rotates around a fixed point is:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Pulley","Wheel and axle","Lever","Inclined plane"]', 'Lever', 'A lever is a bar that pivots on a fulcrum (fixed point).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_mat_005', NULL, 'subj_bece_science', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heat travels through solids by:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["Convection","Radiation","Conduction","Evaporation"]', 'Conduction', 'Conduction is the transfer of heat through solids by direct contact.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_math_2023_001', NULL, 'subj_bece_math', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_math_2023_1', 'Evaluate: 18 ÷ 3 + 4', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. 6", "B. 10", "C. 2", "D. 22"]', 'B', '18 ÷ 3 + 4 = 6 + 4 = 10.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_math_2023_002', NULL, 'subj_bece_math', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_math_2023_1', 'What is 50% of 80?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. 20", "B. 40", "C. 60", "D. 130"]', 'B', '50% of 80 = 0.5 × 80 = 40.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 2, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_bece_math_2023_003', NULL, 'subj_bece_math', 'exam_bece', 'paper_bece_1', 'pp_bece_math_2023_1', 'Simplify: 2/5 × 10', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. 2", "B. 4", "C. 5", "D. 20"]', 'B', '2/5 × 10 = 20/5 = 4.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 3, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
