('q_gov_2024_026', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'An independent electoral commission helps to ensure:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Single party dominance", "B. Free and fair elections", "C. Military intervention", "D. Executive control"]', 'B', 'An independent electoral commission ensures elections are conducted freely and fairly without government interference.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 26, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_027', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'Political apathy refers to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Active political participation", "B. Lack of interest in politics", "C. Military rule", "D. Electoral fraud"]', 'B', 'Political apathy is the lack of interest or indifference towards political affairs and participation.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 27, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_028', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'Proportional representation ensures that:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Winner takes all", "B. Parties get seats proportional to votes", "C. Only two parties exist", "D. Voting is direct"]', 'B', 'Proportional representation allocates legislative seats in proportion to the votes each party receives.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 28, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_029', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'A referendum is used to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Elect the president", "B. Seek public opinion on important issues", "C. Appoint judges", "D. Dissolve parliament"]', 'B', 'A referendum is a direct vote in which the entire electorate is asked to vote on a particular proposal.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 29, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_030', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'The right to vote can be limited for persons who are:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Women", "B. Illiterate", "C. Mentally incapacitated", "D. Poor"]', 'C', 'Voting rights are typically limited for persons who are mentally incapacitated and cannot make informed decisions.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 30, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_031', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'Fundamental human rights are:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Privileges granted by government", "B. Inherent rights of all persons", "C. Rights for citizens only", "D. Rights for adults only"]', 'B', 'Fundamental human rights are inherent to all human beings regardless of nationality, sex, origin, or any other status.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 31, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_032', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'Citizenship by naturalization is acquired through:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Birth", "B. Marriage only", "C. Legal process after meeting requirements", "D. Inheritance"]', 'C', 'Naturalization is a legal process by which a person acquires citizenship after meeting certain requirements.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 32, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_033', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'The right to life can be limited in cases of:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Theft", "B. Lawful execution of court sentence", "C. Unemployment", "D. Political opposition"]', 'B', 'The right to life may be limited in cases of lawful execution following due process of law.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 33, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_034', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'Freedom of speech does NOT include the right to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Express political views", "B. Criticize the government", "C. Incite violence", "D. Publish newspapers"]', 'C', 'Freedom of speech does not protect speech that incites violence, hatred, or causes public disorder.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 34, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_035', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'Civic responsibility includes:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Paying taxes", "B. Evading the law", "C. Political violence", "D. Corruption"]', 'A', 'Paying taxes is a civic responsibility that enables government to provide public services.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 35, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_036', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'The Universal Declaration of Human Rights was adopted in:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. 1945", "B. 1948", "C. 1960", "D. 1963"]', 'B', 'The Universal Declaration of Human Rights was adopted by the UN General Assembly on December 10, 1948.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 36, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_037', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'Which of the following is a political right?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Right to education", "B. Right to vote", "C. Right to work", "D. Right to health"]', 'B', 'The right to vote is a political right that enables citizens to participate in governance.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 37, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_038', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'Dual citizenship means:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Having citizenship of two countries", "B. Living in two countries", "C. Speaking two languages", "D. Having two passports only"]', 'A', 'Dual citizenship is when a person is a citizen of two countries simultaneously.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 38, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_039', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'The Ombudsman is responsible for:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Making laws", "B. Investigating citizens'' complaints against government", "C. Leading the military", "D. Collecting taxes"]', 'B', 'The Ombudsman investigates complaints by citizens against government officials and agencies.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 39, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_040', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'A state of emergency may result in:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Enhanced rights", "B. Suspension of some rights", "C. Permanent dictatorship", "D. Judicial independence"]', 'B', 'During a state of emergency, some constitutional rights may be temporarily suspended for national security.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 40, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_041', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'The African Union (AU) replaced the OAU in:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. 2000", "B. 2002", "C. 2004", "D. 2006"]', 'B', 'The African Union was established in 2002, replacing the Organization of African Unity (OAU).', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 41, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_042', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'ECOWAS was established in:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. 1963", "B. 1975", "C. 1980", "D. 1991"]', 'B', 'The Economic Community of West African States (ECOWAS) was established on May 28, 1975.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 42, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_043', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'The headquarters of the United Nations is located in:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Geneva", "B. New York", "C. London", "D. Paris"]', 'B', 'The United Nations headquarters is located in New York City, United States.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 43, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_044', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'The Security Council of the UN has how many permanent members?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Three", "B. Five", "C. Seven", "D. Ten"]', 'B', 'The UN Security Council has five permanent members: USA, UK, France, Russia, and China.', 'easy', 3, 1, 30, 44, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_045', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'Which organ of the UN deals with international disputes?', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. General Assembly", "B. International Court of Justice", "C. Security Council", "D. Secretariat"]', 'B', 'The International Court of Justice (ICJ) is the principal judicial organ of the UN for settling legal disputes.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 45, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
('q_gov_2024_046', NULL, 'subj_wassce_government', 'exam_wassce', 'paper_wassce_1', 'pp_wassce_gov_2024_1', 'Non-alignment refers to:', 'multiple_choice', NULL, '["A. Joining military alliances", "B. Neutrality during Cold War", "C. Supporting communism", "D. Supporting capitalism"]', 'B', 'Non-alignment was a policy of not aligning with either the Western or Eastern bloc during the Cold War.', 'medium', 3, 1, 30, 46, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z'),
